# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp

# Node / tooling (no build step ships, but tooling may be installed locally)
node_modules/
tmp/
*.log

# Claude Code — the shared config IS part of this repo (CLAUDE.md, skills, agents,
# rules). Only personal overrides stay out.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# tools/ workspace — the coverage report. node_modules/ is ignored above.
tools/coverage/

# The Astro site (site/src, built from docs/): build output,
# caches and build input, never committed. Inside site/src/content/docs/ these lines ARE
# the ownership rule (spec output-ownership-C6): every .md there is a page the mirror
# (tools/src/site/gen-site-docs.ts) copied from docs/, every index.mdx below the top
# folder a hub gen-site-hubs.ts assembled, every page of map/ one gen-map-pages.ts wrote;
# the build deletes and rewrites exactly what they match and nothing else, and
# `make site-clean` is `git clean -X` over the same folders. A hand-written page there is
# .mdx (the home page is the top index.mdx).
site/dist/
site/.astro/
site/coverage/
site/public/kb.js
site/src/content/docs/**/*.md
site/src/content/docs/*/**/index.mdx
site/src/content/docs/map/*.mdx
